 "text": "Hello, how are things going? Try working in quieter room, away from phones and screens. Sitting closer to the window gives your brain a clear signal that day is ahead. You could leave it in another room for set amount of time, or keep it on table with the screen off and notifications off. That's really common. You could ask your neighbours politely if they could keep the noise down during work hours, and offer to help them in return. That's a great idea. Lots of people find that quiet, dimly lit room with good wifi gives them the focus they need.",
